# Built manuscripts in the repository root (main.pdf, proposal.pdf, main-cetak.pdf,
# ...). Each student builds their own. The two template-preview-*.pdf files stay
# tracked to show what the template produces. PDFs in figures/ are not affected:
# rendered TikZ figures are committed so the build works without tikz/.
# To keep your own manuscript PDF in your fork, delete the /*.pdf line below.
/*.pdf
!/template-preview-*.pdf

# LaTeX build artifacts.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz

# Front-matter lists.
*.lof
*.lot
*.loa
*.lap
*.lol

# Emitted when a stray file is compiled without a job name.
texput.log

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Output of tools/siapkan_cetak.py.
siap_cetak_*/
__pycache__/
